@6. The documents
.
=6. THE DOCUMENTS
.
.  GP-BASIC.md
.      the manual -- the keyword reference and the module reference
.
.  GP-BASIC.GLOBALS.md
.      every global name each module owns, and the prefixes you may not use
.
.  GP-BASIC.FILES.md
.      this page
.
.  README.md
.      how to run the compiler, and what its answers mean
.
.  SRC/
.      the BASLOAD source of the tools. Reference only -- nothing in it is
.        needed to run
.
.The library's documents live beside the includes they describe, in this
.folder, so a relative link works both in the repository and in an unzipped
.release.
